            "notes": "[Enlightenment](item_8392e752-ca6b-487d-9580-11eab6075c3c) is the key to this build (and all credit to [awesomerthanpie#0](https://stadiumbuilds.io/profile/3102bdfb-4f81-463d-9679-8c1e2e7a36cb))\n\nIt's also time to consider [Haste Subroutine](item_be06e8c1-baa4-4c24-ae40-c103c45ea0c3) which is especially deadly with the right click.\n\nBut I tend to wait until Round 4 for that as I prefer to get a few defensive items here in case no one is peeling and the enemy has fast flankers.\n\n[Cushioned Padding](item_20f2f4bc-4611-4d1f-b653-20f04d56b96f) is almost always first unless you're mostly taking ability damage.\n\n[Reinforced Titanium](item_8ebaa7db-aedf-48ed-adc1-318cb46a3214) really helps against fire damage ([Ashe](hero_37b42a2d-a82d-4a22-9df2-4c812c873b54)'s especially)\n\n---\n\nRemember: from this round forward, the more damage you do, the more healing you generate for yourself and your [Orb of Harmony](ability_8f354f72-fe40-43b4-8231-aac9c0523c0d) target.",
